All this happend sometimes (without using EXAPixmaps):
Screen rewriting random part of screen with squares (random data).
Fonts are changed to unreadable.
Text change color to different color or it turn invisible.
Whole window of "Konsole" disappear (min/maximalization didn't help, sometimes
help ALT + mouse click, which change windows transparency - that back window to
visible state.

P.S. Looks like this issues mostly depend on work with EXA and advanced using
it by Oxygen or Bespin theme (KDE 4.3). With other themes, problems are rare.
With Oxygen more visible, and with Bespin, which using lot of fades, effects
etc. are most visible.


